			message: '#^Call to function is_subclass_of\(\) with ''Omnifood\\\\Deliveroo\\\\DeliverooPlatformFactory''\|''Omnifood\\\\JustEat\\\\JustEatPlatformFactory''\|''Omnifood\\\\TheFork\\\\TheForkPlatformFactory''\|''Omnifood\\\\UberEats\\\\UberEatsPlatformFactory''\|''Omnifood\\\\Zenchef\\\\ZenchefPlatformFactory'' and ''Omnifood\\\\PlatformFactoryInterface'' will always evaluate to true\.$#'
